            "review_title": "Review at Jeepgo Coffee",
            "review_text": "Do T\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam6 contributions\n0\nThe best coffee. Period.\nMay 2023 • Solo\nCan not believe that this place in Binh Duong serves specialty coffee this properly repaired. And their cold brew coffee were top notch.\n\nClean, cozy space. Have to say their customers were more polite and keep it quite than other coffee shops.\n\nThey roast their own coffee beans. So you can buy cofffee beans their for a great value for money.\nRead more\nWritten May 27, 2023",
